### 声明式接入
#### 适用场景
当实验AB版本**仅需要对****组件UI（样式或布局）进行微调或无需调整，主要是文案或图片的差异，**这时候推荐使用声明式接入；



#### 接入方式
```javascript
import { getABResult, ABTracker } from '@ali/ikkyu-miniapp';
// ... 业务代码
getABResult({ 
      appCode:'ali_fe_ui_test_pre', 
      expId: '7ax3nrln', 
      lazy: false
}).then(result => {
  
      const { mappings = {}, releaseId = "", variationId = "" } = result || {};
      const abTracker = new ABTracker(releaseId, variationId);
      const aliExp = {
        mappings,
        releaseId,
        variationId,
        abTracker
      };

      this.setData({
        aliExp
      })
    });

// ... 业务代码
```



```javascript
// index.axml
 <block>
   <blue-atmosphere a:if="{{aliExp.variationId == '42498'}}" aliExp="{{aliExp}}" />
   <red-atmosphere a:elif="{{aliExp.variationId == '42499'}}" aliExp="{{aliExp}}" />
   <xxx a:else /> 
	 // 兜底处理
 </block>
```



